Package: cellucid
Type: Package
Title: Export Single-Cell Data to the Cellucid Viewer Format
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Kemal", "Inecik",
      email = "k.inecik@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Exports single-cell embeddings, metadata, gene expression, and
    graph connectivity to the binary/JSON interchange format consumed by the
    Cellucid WebGL viewer. The primary entry point is cellucid_prepare(),
    which mirrors the prepare() function in the cellucid Python package.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    methods
Suggests:
    knitr,
    Matrix,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.1.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/theislab/cellucid-r,
    https://theislab.github.io/cellucid-r/
BugReports: https://github.com/theislab/cellucid-r/issues
